@peasant
title: Support a peasant bloc of PSL Wyzwolenie and PSL Piast
subtitle: Agriculture and credit. PPS brokers the agreement but is not on the list, and faces a stronger rival in the countryside.
choose-if: {! return PolishGovernment.listStatus(Q, 'peasant').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_list_peasant_reason +]
on-arrival: {!
var record = PolishGovernment.proposeList(Q, 'peasant');
Q.pl_list_accepted = record.accepted ? 1 : 0;
Q.pl_list_answers = PolishGovernment.describeAnswers(record);
Q.pl_list_name = PolishGovernment.LIST_OPTIONS.peasant.name;
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= The answer

[+ pl_list_answers +]

[? if pl_list_accepted : **[+ pl_list_name +] will stand as one list** at the coming election. ?]

[? if not pl_list_accepted : **No joint list.** PPS keeps its own list. ?]

